{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capyvarias</strong> is a clicker colony game set in a soft post-apocalyptic world. Start with just two capybaras and grow your colony one step at a time. Gather resources, assign tasks, expand your shelter, and unlock strange new technologies discovered by the smartest capybaras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/b396a3a92a44bb8f55129d3ae8de63ef.poster.avif?t=1774360186\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/b396a3a92a44bb8f55129d3ae8de63ef.webm?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/b396a3a92a44bb8f55129d3ae8de63ef.mp4?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your resources either by clicking or by assigning capybaras to rooms in your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/3007622eddb91cb47d95aa6a985ea21f.poster.avif?t=1774360186\" width=770 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/3007622eddb91cb47d95aa6a985ea21f.webm?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/3007622eddb91cb47d95aa6a985ea21f.mp4?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Technology and Upgrade your Colony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new technology and innovation to advance your colony. Watch your shelter evolve as you transition through different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/6f9b7218a4c303bf0ca925375ac6eed2.poster.avif?t=1774360186\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/6f9b7218a4c303bf0ca925375ac6eed2.webm?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/6f9b7218a4c303bf0ca925375ac6eed2.mp4?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achievements and Outfits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer achievements to gather <strong>Capycoins</strong>. Use your hard-earned currency to buy adorable outfits and raise up the style of your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/ec755f1334dea33140bd0a178e24df74.poster.avif?t=1774360186\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/ec755f1334dea33140bd0a178e24df74.webm?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/ec755f1334dea33140bd0a178e24df74.mp4?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 What Capyvarias offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short clicker</strong>: demo is 10 to 15 minutes of playtime, dynamic resource management and light decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple game mechanics</strong>: Increase your resources, upgrade to get new ones, and advance through time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A post-apocalyptic cozy vibe</strong>: Hand-drawn capybaras, cute art and lovely music!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c What Capyvarias does <strong>NOT</strong> offer:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No idler</strong>: This is an active experience. Leaving your capybaras unattended for too long can lead to losing the colony!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No prestige levels</strong>: The game does not offer permanent upgrades that are kept over different colony runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No deep narrative</strong> and many hours-long objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No multiplayer</strong> of any kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm <strong>Kirani</strong>, and this is my first game. The fantastic art you see in the game is made by my amazing friend <strong>Jess</strong>! Music and sound effects are carefully selected assets.  I hope you like my cozy game made with love.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072340?t=1774360186","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/2a676536edc3c6888e98a79ae108e43c2a423ff8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774360186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/11e3fb1145e90eca015e02efbc3e1a450ecb50ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774360186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/11e3fb1145e90eca015e02efbc3e1a450ecb50ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774360186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4081600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capyvarias</strong> is a clicker colony game set in a soft post-apocalyptic world. Start with just two capybaras and grow your colony one step at a time. Gather resources, assign tasks, expand your shelter, and unlock strange new technologies discovered by the smartest capybaras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/b396a3a92a44bb8f55129d3ae8de63ef.poster.avif?t=1774360186\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/b396a3a92a44bb8f55129d3ae8de63ef.webm?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/b396a3a92a44bb8f55129d3ae8de63ef.mp4?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your resources either by clicking or by assigning capybaras to rooms in your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/3007622eddb91cb47d95aa6a985ea21f.poster.avif?t=1774360186\" width=770 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/3007622eddb91cb47d95aa6a985ea21f.webm?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/3007622eddb91cb47d95aa6a985ea21f.mp4?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Technology and Upgrade your Colony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new technology and innovation to advance your colony. Watch your shelter evolve as you transition through different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/6f9b7218a4c303bf0ca925375ac6eed2.poster.avif?t=1774360186\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/6f9b7218a4c303bf0ca925375ac6eed2.webm?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/6f9b7218a4c303bf0ca925375ac6eed2.mp4?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achievements and Outfits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer achievements to gather <strong>Capycoins</strong>. Use your hard-earned currency to buy adorable outfits and raise up the style of your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/ec755f1334dea33140bd0a178e24df74.poster.avif?t=1774360186\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/ec755f1334dea33140bd0a178e24df74.webm?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/extras/ec755f1334dea33140bd0a178e24df74.mp4?t=1774360186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2705 What Capyvarias offers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short clicker</strong>: demo is 10 to 15 minutes of playtime, dynamic resource management and light decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple game mechanics</strong>: Increase your resources, upgrade to get new ones, and advance through time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A post-apocalyptic cozy vibe</strong>: Hand-drawn capybaras, cute art and lovely music!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u274c What Capyvarias does <strong>NOT</strong> offer:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No idler</strong>: This is an active experience. Leaving your capybaras unattended for too long can lead to losing the colony!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No prestige levels</strong>: The game does not offer permanent upgrades that are kept over different colony runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No deep narrative</strong> and many hours-long objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No multiplayer</strong> of any kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm <strong>Kirani</strong>, and this is my first game. The fantastic art you see in the game is made by my amazing friend <strong>Jess</strong>! Music and sound effects are carefully selected assets.  I hope you like my cozy game made with love.</p>","developers":["Piebox"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072340/f9467ac1893e1e937716cc3b49dce83ad51b295f/header.jpg?t=1774360186","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04, SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</stron